        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Single-Si wafer, photovoltaics, at regional storage
Shares of production in Europe (85%) and import from China (15%).;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, cadmium telluride, thin film; 
UUID: 6f122316-9581-3534-a3ce-a16e7c242dbd
Domestic production and imports of single-crystalline silicon wafers used in photovoltaic cell production in Europe. Transport from different world regions to regional storage.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: None
Time period: Data refer to 2018
Production volume: na
Sampling: Survey among market intelligence companies 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6f122316-9581-3534-a3ce-a16e7c242dbd.xml</text>
